Trademarked names (UML, BPMN, ArchiMate, TOGAF, etc.) referenced herein are property of their respective owners.'''@en ;
    <http://purl.org/net/SMARTprotocol#IntroductionSection> '''
     Core Linked.Archi Ontology for EA modeling.
